dual_cyclic_d04_n08
* Dual of a cyclic d-polytope on n=2d moment-curve points.
* Parameters: t = +1,...,+d,-1,...,-d.
* Let u(t)=(t,t^2,...,t^d), c=(1/(2d)) sum_t u(t), and N_t=d(u(t)-c).
* This file encodes N_t x <= d; lrs convention is d - N_t x >= 0.
